  "body": "Step into elevated coastal living with this spacious, split-level sanctuary capturing panoramic views of the glistening Hauraki Gulf and beyond. Tucked peacefully back from the road on an easy-care 450 m² (more or less) freehold section, this residence has been a proven investment for over 20 years and is now ready to reward its next owner.\r\n\r\nThe middle level forms the vibrant heart of the home, offering an open plan kitchen, dining, and living area that flows seamlessly onto a sun-drenched deck. It is the ultimate backdrop for alfresco dining, hosting guests, or simply soaking in the mesmerizing blue horizons.\r\n\r\nThoughtfully designed with maximum separation in mind, the upper floor is dedicated entirely to a private master suite, creating a peaceful retreat far removed from the rest of the household.\r\n\r\nThe lower level adds incredible versatility to the property, featuring two additional double bedrooms, a full family bathroom, and a massive second living space with its own separate access. This flexible footprint makes the home an exceptional match for families with teenagers, extended living, boarders, a dedicated home office, or those seeking a “lock and leave” coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\nA double internal-access garage with built in laundry completes the practical foundation, while the well maintained structure offers an extraordinary canvas for anyone looking to add value. While perfectly livable as it is, the interior offers an exceptional opportunity to touch up and instantly add further value. With CCC issued in 2005, this remarkable residence has a cavity system and has been well maintained since new. A Pre-Sale Building Inspection Report is available upon request.\r\n\r\nSituated in a convenient location; wander to the Northcross shops, short drive to Long Bay, Waiake and Browns Bay for beaches, local eateries and amenities. Albany Mall, Bus station and local motorway links are within easy reach. You’re in zone for Glamorgan Primary School, Northcross Intermediate, and Long Bay College.\r\n\r\nWhether you are an investor, a growing family, or a buyer with a creative vision, this home presents a rare chance to secure premium views and endless potential.\r\n\r\nContact us today to schedule your private viewing and explore the possibilities.",
